Simplest: dust parented to camera? Add dust group as child of camera; positions fixed in local space [-8,8]; it follows camera but appears to stay relative, acceptable. But when camera rotates, dust rotates with it (bad, looks like static dirt on lens; maybe good for camcorder dust). Actually dust in front of camera rotating with it is realistic for lens dust? But fixed in world should parallax. Could add as child of scene and wrap around camera positions each frame using base offsets and camera pos:
