```
This ensures particles are always within 8 of camera; as camera moves, particles wrap, which is fine for subtle dust. y = baseY (0.2..3.0) fixed world; z wrap. Update only positions that moved enough? 380*3 per frame trivial. Do it. Add slight upward drift using baseY+time*0.02 mod 3.2.

