Keyboard listeners:
- keydown: set keys[code]=true; if code Space prevent; if KeyZ zoomHeld=true; if KeyM toggleMute; if Escape (state playing -> pause; paused -> resume?); if KeyP pause. Also if state intro and Enter/Space -> start.
- keyup: keys[code]=false; if KeyZ zoomHeld=false.
